        <mxCell id="sequence-note" value="Question: what happens between Lan accepting a cover request and the roster changing, and what does each person see when the roster update fails?&lt;br&gt;Source: build-spec.md Integrations and data (I1), Business rules BR2, States and lifecycle (Accepted, Needs roster fix), and message M2. The 30 s timeout is a proposed default.&lt;br&gt;Proposed. It does not test the roster system's real behaviour, its response times, or retries." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="750" width="1140" height="88" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
